OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFine, with variable and often
OL,6,Flarge amounts of cloud, but also
OL,7,Foccasional sunny spells. Feeling warm,
OL,8,Fespecially in the sunshine, with only
OL,9,Flight winds. Cloud gradually
OL,10,Fthickening through the afternoon, with
OL,11,Fthe odd shower then possible in the
OL,12,Fnorthwest.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FCloud thickening further
OL,15,Fovernight, with widespread and
OL,16,Fpersistent rain moving in after
OL,17,Fmidnight. Rain will be mostly light,
OL,18,Fbut with some heavier bursts likely,
OL,19,Fespecially in east. Staying mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
