OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA wet start, with overnight
OL,6,Frain continuing, before gradually
OL,7,Fclearing east through the day. Turning
OL,8,Fbrighter but also fresher from the
OL,9,Fwest, with all parts dry by the late
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FFine
OL,13,Fday Thursday after a chilly start,
OL,14,Fbefore rain and stronger winds spread
OL,15,Feast overnight. Breezy Friday and
OL,16,FSaturday, with plenty of drier
OL,17,Fintervals, but also further outbreaks
OL,18,Fof rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
